    "input": "search_document: Based on the handbook excerpts provided, here is the information regarding your declined transaction and payment timing:\n\n**Reason for Decline**\nThe handbook states that if a payment is declined due to insufficient funds or a **security flag**, the order is automatically canceled [payments.4]. Since your bank confirmed the funds were available, it is possible the decline was triggered by a security flag rather than insufficient funds. The handbook does not provide specific details on what triggers a security flag or how to resolve it directly, but it notes that multiple failed attempts within 24 hours may result in a temporary suspension of your account for 7 days for security review [payments.4].\n\n**Retry Window and Inventory**\nYou have **48 hours** from the time of the decline to retry the payment with a different method [payments.4]. If you do not complete the payment within this window, the reserved inventory is released back to the general stock pool, and we do not hold items for failed transactions beyond this period [payments.4].\n\n**Authorization Holds**\nWhen you place a new order, we immediately authorize the full amount on your payment method [payments.2]. This authorization hold typically lasts for **3 to 5 business days** [payments.2]. The actual capture of funds occurs only after we have shipped your items [payments.2]. If your order is canceled before shipment, the authorization will be released automatically within 7 business days, though some banks may take up to 10 business days to remove the hold [payments.2].\n\n**Payment Limits**\nThe maximum single purchase amount for credit card transactions is **$5,000.00** [payments.1]. Since you stated your order was just under this threshold, the limit itself should not have been the cause of the decline, provided the total did not exceed $5,000.00. If your order total does exceed this threshold, you must split the payment into multiple transactions or use an alternative payment method [payments.1].\n\n**Recommendation**\nSince the handbook does not specify how to clear a security flag or investigate a specific declined transaction, I cannot determine the exact reason for the rejection from the provided text. To ensure the next attempt goes through and to address the security flag issue, I recommend escalating this ticket to a human agent who can review your specific account status and transaction history.\n\n[payments.1]\n[payments.2]\n[payments.4]",
